# the journal full: a session of many saves (one session had 65: 22 dropouts, every save after the ~32
# prepared slots erasing OBJ_PROJ). Now 56 are prepared, and a full journal reclaims a sector of itself in a quiet
# moment: OBJ_PROJ is never erased, the newest save always wins, and a power cut mid-save still leaves the one before
wait 800
press HOME
wait 800
release HOME
wait 100
expect mode 0
expect jr_reclaims 0
turn SELECT 1 80
wait 70
tap SAVE
wait 30
